  "modelNote": "Demonstration of legend-as-registry: every node and edge points at a legend row (node.type / edge.type) and takes its look from it. Change a row and every follower changes. Icons come from the RCN house library (tools/rcn-icons.js). Built 2026-07-25 as the test case for icon nodes + SVG legend.",
